@startuml
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

!include _retriever-classes.iuml

ConversationEngine ..> condensation : 1. condense_and_extract
ConversationEngine ..> CondensationResult : uses query and boost
ConversationEngine ..> retriever : 2. retrieve
ConversationEngine ..> prompts : 3. build_user_message
ConversationEngine ..> context : 4. build_context
ConversationEngine --> BedrockLLMClient : answer client
ConversationEngine --> BedrockLLMClient : condensation client\n(short timeout, no retry)
ConversationEngine ..> vstore : opens collection,\nreads model id and schema
ConversationEngine --> Settings

condensation ..> BedrockLLMClient : generate_json
condensation ..> CondensationResult : returns

retriever ..> ranking : rerank
retriever ..> RankingConfig

ranking ..> RankingConfig

Settings ..> RankingConfig : ranking_config()

BedrockLLMClient ..> Settings : model id, region

note bottom of retriever
  Over-fetches top_k * overfetch_factor candidates
  so that boost and recency can promote a chunk
  from further down the similarity ranking.
end note

remove @unlinked
@enduml
